Good is rewarded and evil punished?

281
00:21:40,300 --> 00:21:42,300
The wheel of fate turns?

282
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:45,280
Then what did Sister and Azhe do wrong

283
00:21:46,140 --> 00:21:48,760
to end up like this?

284
00:21:49,180 --> 00:21:49,980
No.

285
00:21:50,170 --> 00:21:50,970
No.

286
00:21:51,460 --> 00:21:53,199
The destiny of Heaven and Earth

287
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:55,060
is not bound to one person's life.

288
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:57,110
I will let you know

289
00:21:57,600 --> 00:21:59,530
how the ancestors of the Dou family

290
00:21:59,650 --> 00:22:01,940
broke the tide of fate.

291
00:22:02,840 --> 00:22:04,540
See for yourself.

292
00:22:05,260 --> 00:22:07,240
This is not an illusion,

293
00:22:08,020 --> 00:22:10,900
but the inherited memories

294
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:13,560
of the past masters
of the Turtle Treasure.

295
00:22:21,760 --> 00:22:22,560
Father.

296
00:22:23,230 --> 00:22:24,730
{\an8}[Young Dou Jingshan]

297
00:22:23,280 --> 00:22:24,639
The guests have all arrived,

298
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:25,839
waiting to celebrate your birthday.

299
00:22:25,840 --> 00:22:26,840
What are you...

300
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:29,520
Jingshan.

301
00:22:30,040 --> 00:22:31,999
From now on, the big boss of Ganzi Gang

302
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:33,200
is you.

303
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:36,480
Where are you going?

304
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:38,149
If I don't come back,

305
00:22:38,150 --> 00:22:39,879
remember two things.

306
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:40,770
First,

307
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:42,409
the stone box in the Buddhist hall

308
00:22:42,410 --> 00:22:43,530
must not be moved.

309
00:22:44,040 --> 00:22:44,859
Second,

310
00:22:44,860 --> 00:22:46,229
the descendants of the Dou family

311
00:22:46,230 --> 00:22:48,569
are forbidden to touch the affair
of treasure hunting.

312
00:22:48,570 --> 00:22:49,570
The old gentleman

313
00:22:50,680 --> 00:22:52,940
is actually my biological grandfather!

314
00:23:04,600 --> 00:23:07,890
I must go to the Ancient Town!

315
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:21,400
You may escape for now,

316
00:23:22,450 --> 00:23:24,770
but you can't escape your fate!

317
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:27,920
You will die a horrible death!

318
00:24:08,500 --> 00:24:09,679
The magic blade in his hand

319
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:11,999
is forged from a supreme earthly treasure.

320
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:13,939
It has drunk the blood
of countless people,

321
00:24:13,940 --> 00:24:15,930
and its power is immeasurable.

322
00:24:18,130 --> 00:24:20,260
If you don't bury the Turtle Treasure,

323
00:24:20,710 --> 00:24:22,730
even if you die a hundred times,

324
00:24:23,120 --> 00:24:24,920
there is nothing you can change.

325
00:24:25,370 --> 00:24:27,660
The Fate for revenge has not yet arrived.

326
00:24:28,560 --> 00:24:30,759
You must first find Heavenly Treasure,

327
00:24:30,760 --> 00:24:33,290
and then capture
Seven Rods and Eight Vajras.

328
00:24:33,690 --> 00:24:35,250
- From now on,
- From now on,

329
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:37,279
- seize the heavenly and earthly treasures
- seize the heavenly and earthly treasures

330
00:24:37,280 --> 00:24:38,299
- for my use.
- for my use.

331
00:24:38,300 --> 00:24:40,149
- Change karma and destiny.
- Change karma and destiny.

332
00:24:40,150 --> 00:24:41,469
- I alone decide!
- I alone decide!

333
00:24:41,470 --> 00:24:42,809
If this revenge is not taken,

334
00:24:42,810 --> 00:24:45,119
I have no face
to stand between Heaven and Earth.

335
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:46,399
I will get back

336
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:47,499
everything I lost!

337
00:24:47,500 --> 00:24:51,110
No matter what the cost is!

338
00:24:53,650 --> 00:24:56,990
Dou Zhanlong remembered
the agreement with his sister.

339
00:24:57,360 --> 00:24:58,709
Even when being hunted down,

340
00:24:58,710 --> 00:25:01,109
trapped in the deep mountains
and about to freeze to death,

341
00:25:01,110 --> 00:25:03,090
he didn't waver at all.

342
00:25:04,250 --> 00:25:07,679
Returning home
only to find his sister dead,

343
00:25:07,680 --> 00:25:10,080
he resolutely buried the Turtle Treasure.

344
00:25:12,320 --> 00:25:13,400
Next,

345
00:25:14,040 --> 00:25:15,379
to slay the White-Faced Wolf,

346
00:25:15,380 --> 00:25:17,439
avenge the blood feud of the Dou family,

347
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:18,519
and to bring back

348
00:25:18,520 --> 00:25:20,000
Azhe and his Sister,

349
00:25:20,360 --> 00:25:21,819
he will head to Jiangnan

350
00:25:21,820 --> 00:25:24,000
to seek the world-altering

351
00:25:24,600 --> 00:25:27,360
Heavenly Treasure!

352
00:25:28,080 --> 00:25:29,499
What dangers will Dou Zhanlong

353
00:25:29,500 --> 00:25:32,339
encounter on the road to Jiangnan?

354
00:25:32,340 --> 00:25:34,740
Can he find his Fate?

355
00:25:36,740 --> 00:25:37,770
We'll tell

356
00:25:39,280 --> 00:25:41,840
next time!

